=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the **???** in {z:Arrapago Reef} at (H-10) Map 1 for a cutscene.
** A {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219} is required to reach this point.
** Lamian Fang Keys drop from {p:Lamiae|Category:Lamiae} and {p:Draugers|Category:Skeleton} in the area.
** You can also receive a Lamian Fang Key from a **???** spot in {z:Caedarva Mire} (I-7) Map 1 (southern part of the block). You can obtain a new key from there once every game day.
* **You no longer have to be on {p:Corsair} for the rest of this quest.**
* You are asked to fish up a {i:Hydrogauge|Hydrogauge|2341}.
** The item you need must be fished up in {z:Al Zahbi}, {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, {z:Nashmau}, or the {z:Ferry - Nashmau/Al Zahbi}.
** You may use any rod and bait
** The fishing message you will receive is the standard item message, "You feel something pulling at your line".
*** It is suggested to use any rod for large fish (ie: {i:S.H. Fishing Rod|S.H. Fishing Rod|17382}) and {p:Insect Balls|Insect Ball} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} as this has a limited number of fish that may interfere with your fishing attempts.
** Complete the fishing mini-game. When the fish gauge turns dark grey, press the Action button (A on Xbox controller) to reel in the fish/item
* Once you've fished up a {i:Hydrogauge|Hydrogauge|2341}, trade it to {q:Leleroon|Leleroon|Leleroon}, {z:Nashmau} (G-7).
* Head to (G-8) in {z:Wajaom Woodlands} and trade the {i:Hydrogauge|Hydrogauge|2341} to the **Leypoint**.
** This can be reached quickly using an {i:Olduum Ring|Olduum Ring|15769}
** The {p:Survival Guide} is also fairly close-by.
* Wait one minute, then examine the **Leypoint** again.
* Return to the **???** in {z:Arrapago Reef} at (H-10) Map 1 for your reward.

